<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Firing sniper without extension.
Setting : 
If you want to fire macro with RMB, make sure the RMB is not used for any use.
And set the extension with different key.

Its good enough without QC, but best with QC </Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
Delay 25 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 23 ms
KeyDown 32 1
Delay 25 ms
KeyUp 32 1
Delay 23 ms
KeyDown 30 1
Delay 25 ms
KeyUp 30 1
Delay 23 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Point Blank</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>